            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p>Grab your pass for the Film Industry Network:</p><p>🎟️ <strong><strong>Filmmaker Pro Pass</strong></strong></p><p>Level up your festival experience with full 2-day access to:</p><ul><li><strong><strong>All film screenings &amp; industry talks</strong></strong></li><li><strong><strong>Indie Film Forum access</strong></strong></li><li><strong><strong>Film Pitch Fund finalists' presentations</strong></strong></li><li><strong><strong>1:1 mentoring session with an industry expert</strong></strong></li><li><strong><strong>On-site Film Workshops</strong></strong></li><li><strong><strong>Free course: </strong></strong><em><strong><strong>Festival Promotion &amp; Distribution Strategies</strong></strong></em></li><li><strong><strong>Film Festival Radar Workshop to support your film festival  </strong></strong><strong><strong>strategy and journey within the festival circuit (Free credits bonus to attendees)</strong></strong></li><li><strong><strong>Red Carpet Meet &amp; Greet reception</strong></strong></li></ul><p>Perfect for directors, producers, and creators ready to connect, learn, and grow.</p><p><br></p><p>🎭 <strong><strong>Actor Pro Pass</strong></strong></p><p>Step into the spotlight with 2-day access designed for actors looking to connect and grow:</p><ul><li><strong><strong>All film screenings &amp; industry talks</strong></strong></li><li><strong><strong>1:1 or paired career advice with an industry expert</strong></strong></li><li><strong><strong>Entry to the Indie Film Forum</strong></strong></li><li><strong><strong>Red Carpet Meet &amp; Greet reception</strong></strong></li><li><strong><strong>Film Pitch Fund finalists' presentations (great for spotting roles &amp; collaborators)</strong></strong></li><li><strong><strong>Mentoring, Speed Dating</strong></strong></li><li><strong><strong>Stage Combat Workshop, Actor / Director Workshop</strong></strong></li></ul><p>Ideal for performers seeking visibility, insight, and meaningful industry connections.</p>",
              "alignment": "left",
