              "embedUrl": null
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p><br></p><p><strong><strong>EXPAND YOUR NETWORK</strong></strong></p><p>Network with <strong><strong>fellow filmmakers, industry professionals, and film festival finalists</strong></strong> and get the chance to establish enduring connections that can shape your professional path.</p><p>Join us for an incredible opportunity to connect and collaborate with <strong><strong>fellow filmmakers,</strong></strong> <strong><strong>actors, film producers, and indie-film career mentors</strong></strong>.</p><p>Whether you're scouting for talented cast and crew, exploring exciting new projects, or keen to delve into your next funding application, this event provides the perfect setting to discuss your current and future endeavours, all while enjoying a drink in a vibrant atmosphere surrounded by inspiring individuals. All of this within the framework of a<strong><strong> diversity-driven, auteur-focused, independent, and international film festival.</strong></strong></p><p><strong><strong>Irrespective of your level of experience</strong></strong>, whether you're a seasoned filmmaker or just starting in the industry, we warmly invite everyone to attend.</p><p>We kindly invite you to specify your current job title and/or career aspiration at checkout. This information helps us serve you better.</p><p>For more information about MiraBan, please visit:</p><p><a href=\"https://www.mirabanukfilmawards.co.uk\" title=\"https://www.mirabanukfilmawards.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" data-msys-clicktrack=\"0\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">www.miraban.com</a></p><p>Take a glimpse at the captivating moments from our previous events:</p>",
